The marks in this folder come from lobe-icons (https://github.com/lobehub/lobe-icons),
drawn as one-colour SVG. They are the trademarks of their owners and name the
maker or the provider of a model; framy is not affiliated with any of them.

Three marks lobe-icons does not have were taken from the makers' own sites,
their paths unchanged but scaled into the same 24 x 24 box and filled with
one colour. They are not covered by the MIT License below:

- heygen.svg: the symbol of heygen-full-black-logo.svg in HeyGen's brand kit,
  https://dynamic.heygen.ai/Heygen%20Brand-kit/heygen-brandkit.zip, linked
  from https://www.heygen.com/brand-kit (downloaded 31 October 2026).
- sourceful.svg: the round mark of the Sourceful logo at the top of
  https://sourceful.com/ (31 October 2026).
- tbc.svg: the mark of The Biological Computing Co. logo at the top of
  https://www.tbc.co/, the same as in its lockup with the company's name
  (31 October 2026).

